# #audio music "res://assets/music/VN music.wav"

[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/mummy BG.png" fade="2.0"]

[i]In front of you stands a majestic and aweing house, impressively held with pillars and grandeur[/i]
[i]It seems welcoming but you are still off put by your previous encounters[/i]
[i]You slowly make your way up the steps and ring the bright shiny doorbell on the wall[/i]
audio "res://assets/sfx/Mummy Doorbell.wav"

*Ring a Ling Ding*
[i]The door opens and a gust of warm air hits your face[/i]

MC: “Mommy?... Sorry mummy?”

join MUMMY (default) center

[i]In front of you standing tall is a Mummy, the linen around her head pulled up with… hair curlers?[/i]
[i]Next to her a bassinet, its center so dark you feel drawn into it[/i]

MUMMY: “Hello?”
MUMMY: “Who might be knocking at my door at this hour?”

MC
- “Uh… Hi! how are you…?”
- “Trick or treat?”

[i]Your body is tense, expecting the worst[/i]
[i]You hear a light chuckle making its way from the doorway[/i]

MC: (I knew I picked the wrong dialogue option)

MUMMY: “And I am the one who usually asks the questions”

join MUMMY (happy) center

MUMMY: “I would usually make you pass my trials but you are just so adorable in that little outfit”
MUMMY: “My son is very fond of costumes like these”
MUMMY: “An Eternal Pharaoh but he will always be my little baby”

join MUMMY (default) center

[i]You stare back at the bassinet, its gloomy aura softening, becoming more regal and inviting[/i]

MC: “Does he like trick or treating?”

join MUMMY (happy) center

MUMMY: “Oh he loves it! I love dressing him up like his father Tutankhamen”
MUMMY: “We have finished for the night but he is not old enough for candy and I do not eat it either”

join MUMMY (default) center

MUMMY: “Would you be happening to want some?”

MC: “If you wouldn’t mind”

MUMMY: “Of course silly blue hedgehog”
MUMMY: “However, do not expect it to come on a silver plate”
MUMMY: “I may not be a Sphinx but I think their games are just oh-so fun”
MUMMY: “So please show me why you deserve all this candy”
audio music "res://assets/music/Mummy Perfect Loop.wav"

[signal arg="battle_ui"]

# #START BATTLE
# #ROUND 1
MUMMY: “I would ask you for a riddle but I am sure you already know which one I am asking for. Please give me the answer”
- A Human
	set {choice_id} = "A"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	join MUMMY (happy) center
	MUMMY: “Well done little one, very well done”
	join MUMMY (default) center
- The Night and the Day
	set {choice_id} = "B"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “Not quite but almost there silly”
- To be honest,... :(
	MC: I don’t know what riddle you’re talking about I’m sorry
	set {choice_id} = "C"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “You poor little baby it’s alright”
- Just give me the candy
	set {choice_id} = "D"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “You’re not going to get anywhere like that”
[b]{reaction_1}[/b]

# #ROUND 2
MUMMY: “You are such a sweet little child, I am amazed you ended up on this street”
- Secure help
	MC: I don’t know how it happened
	set {choice_id} = "A"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “It will be alright child, I will help you find your way home”
- Built different
	MC: I’m just built different I guess
	set {choice_id} = "B"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “What do you mean by that?”
- Tear up
	MC: It’s been a lot but at least I get my candy
	set {choice_id} = "C"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	join MUMMY (happy) center
	MUMMY: “We will make sure you get lots of candy little one”
	join MUMMY (default) center
- Thug it out
	MC: But I will make sure this street knows who runs it
	set {choice_id} = "D"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “Delusions are not to be played with child”
[b]{reaction_2}[/b]

# #ROUND 3
MUMMY: “Before I give you your reward I have one final question for you.”
MUMMY: “What are you planning on doing with all this candy? I have been quite curious about this for a while now”
- Save it
	MC: I was going to save it and have a little bit every day
	set {choice_id} = "A"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “What a smart child you are!”
- Eat it all at once!!!
	set {choice_id} = "B"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “If that is your wish so be it”
- Share it
	MC: I will share it with my friends when I get back home
	set {choice_id} = "C"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	join MUMMY (happy) center
	MUMMY: “Your heart is so kind, your mother must be very proud”
	join MUMMY (default) center
- None of your business
	set {choice_id} = "D"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	MUMMY: “Then you don’t deserve it”
[b]{reaction_3}[/b]

if {outcome} == "fail":
	[i]The Mummy looks sadly at you and shakes her head begrudgingly[/i]
	
	MUMMY: “You are quite a misbehaved child, so rude and gaudy”
	MUMMY: “You will not be receiving any candy from me, hurry along now before the desert swallows you up”
	[i]She looks at her bassinet as she says that last sentence, sending shivers down your spine[/i]
	[i]You walk away slowly, looking back to see her standing[/i]
	[i]Standing guard[/i]
	[i]Protecting[/i]

elif {outcome} == "success":
	MUMMY: “Well done little one, you have proven yourself admirably”
	MUMMY: “You did such a good job, it would be nice to see you come by more often”
	
	[i]She hands you a large bag of candy and smiles[/i]
	
	MUMMY: “Hurry along now child before it gets too late, you must still have some houses to get to”
	
	[i]You walk away, now with two bags filled with candy, ready for more[/i]
else:
	[b] did not fail nor succeed [/b]

[signal arg="next_house"]